# Docs sync

When you change journeys, IA, mock contracts, or prototype scope, update the matching files under the **current app** in the same PR when practical.

| Change | Update (under `apps/<slug>/` or the example if that is the app) |
| --- | --- |
| New / dropped flow | `docs/flows/` + journeys index (`docs/inputs/03-priority-journeys.md` or equivalent) |
| Screen or nav change | `docs/inputs/04-ia-and-screens.md` |
| Fixture shape | `docs/inputs/05-mock-data-contracts.md` |
| New feasibility finding | `docs/inputs/08-feasibility-questions.md` |
| Success bar change | `docs/inputs/09-success-metrics.md` |

Do not silently promote deferred journeys into the running app. Non-goals in the concept brief still apply.

New customer apps: `apps/<slug>/`. Example-only edits: `apps/examples/project-health/docs/`.
